### Local working data — bundles, GTFS/STIF, replay fixtures (RUNBOOK.md §3, §10)
# Large and partly proprietary: a built whole-MTA bundle alone is ~800 MB, and the STIF it derives
# from is not public. This rule lived only in individual clones' .git/info/exclude, so it never
